msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan {#step-2-optimize-problem-for-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We are now ready to transpile the circuit to the hardware. We will transpile both the unitary standard implementation and the dynamic circuit implementation to the hardware.\n"
msgstr "Kita sudah bersedia untuk mentranspil Circuit ke perkakasan. Kita akan mentranspil kedua-dua pelaksanaan piawai unitari dan pelaksanaan Circuit dinamik ke perkakasan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To transpile to hardware, we first instantiate the backend. If available, we will choose a backend where the [`MidCircuitMeasure`](/guides/measure-qubits) (`measure_2`) instruction is supported.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mentranspil ke perkakasan, kita mula-mula instantiate Backend. Jika tersedia, kita akan memilih Backend di mana arahan [`MidCircuitMeasure`](/guides/measure-qubits) (`measure_2`) disokong.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpilation for dynamic circuits {#transpilation-for-dynamic-circuits}"
msgstr "Transpilasi untuk Circuit dinamik {#transpilation-for-dynamic-circuits}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, we transpile the dynamic circuits, with and without adding the DD sequence. To ensure we use the same set of physical qubits in all circuits for more consistent results, we first transpile the circuit once, and then use its layout for all subsequent circuits, specified by [`initial_layout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#initial_layout) in the pass manager. We then construct the [primitive unified blocs](/guides/primitive-input-output) (PUBs) as the Sampler primitive input.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, kita mentranspil Circuit dinamik, dengan dan tanpa menambah urutan DD. Untuk memastikan kita menggunakan set qubit fizikal yang sama dalam semua Circuit bagi hasil yang lebih konsisten, kita mentranspil Circuit sekali dahulu, kemudian menggunakan tataletak itu untuk semua Circuit seterusnya, yang ditentukan oleh [`initial_layout`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#initial_layout) dalam pengurus laluan. Kita kemudian membina [blok bersatu primitif](/guides/primitive-input-output) (PUB) sebagai input primitif Sampler.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We can visualize the qubit layout of the transpiled circuit below. The black circles show the data qubits and the ancilla qubits used in the dynamic circuit implementation.\n"
msgstr "Kita boleh visualisasikan tataletak qubit Circuit yang telah ditranspil di bawah. Bulatan hitam menunjukkan qubit data dan qubit ancilla yang digunakan dalam pelaksanaan Circuit dinamik.\n"

